[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3902.47, "timestamp": "01:05:02", "text": "请假。 情况很糟糕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3904.63, "timestamp": "01:05:04", "text": "今天因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3907.51, "timestamp": "01:05:07", "text": "下雨，我也做了类似的事情。 我觉得我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3915.51, "timestamp": "01:05:15", "text": "今天请假一天的后果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3917.91, "timestamp": "01:05:17", "text": "可能很快就会显现出来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3919.829, "timestamp": "01:05:19", "text": "是的，我不能开始懈怠。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3923.51, "timestamp": "01:05:23", "text": "即使是日本，规定也很严格。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3928.309, "timestamp": "01:05:28", "text": "嗯，印度人。 没事。 一切都好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3930.309, "timestamp": "01:05:30", "text": "巴卡的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3934.39, "timestamp": "01:05:34", "text": "规则就是规则。 巴卡，规则就是规则。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3938.63, "timestamp": "01:05:38", "text": "即使我向一些人寻求帮助，呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3942.63, "timestamp": "01:05:42", "text": "遵守规则也无关紧要。 我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3951.109, "timestamp": "01:05:51", "text": "，我会回来的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3957.51, "timestamp": "01:05:57", "text": "是的，我总是在直播中这么说，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3959.829, "timestamp": "01:05:59", "text": "但是，"}]